{% extends 'base.html.twig' %}

{% block title %}AC12.05 – Deploying transmission media{% endblock %}

{% block body %}
    <div class="container">

        <h1>AC12.05 – Deploying transmission media</h1>

        <p>
            <strong>Objective :</strong>
            Set up and test different transmission media
            in order to ensure proper network communication.
        </p>

        <hr>

        <h2>Reflective analysis</h2>

        <p>
            During the VoIP practical work using FreePBX and SIP softphones,
            I learned how network communications are established between
            different devices within a local network.
        </p>

        <p>
            I configured several telephone endpoints through an IPBX,
            setting up SIP extensions and testing calls between users.
            These tasks allowed me to understand how voice communications
            are transmitted through the network using different protocols.
        </p>

        <p>
            I also used tools such as Wireshark to observe data exchanges
            during phone calls and during the registration process of devices
            on the IPBX.
        </p>

        <p>
            Thanks to connectivity tests (ping) and SIP phone configuration,
            I was able to verify the correct operation of the network
            and identify the steps required to establish a VoIP communication.
        </p>

        <p>
            This activity helped me understand the role of the network
            in voice transmission and the overall functioning of a VoIP infrastructure.
        </p>

        <h2>Supporting documents</h2>

        <ul>
            <li>Configuration of SIP phones on FreePBX.</li>
            <li>Configuration of 3CX Phone softphones.</li>
            <li>Call tests between users.</li>
            <li>Wireshark captures of SIP/RTP exchanges.</li>
            <li>Network connectivity test results (ping).</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Illustrative image</h2>

        <div style="text-align:center; margin-top:10px;">
            <img src="{{ asset('images/ac1205.png') }}"
                 alt="AC12.05 VoIP and network"
                 style="max-width:100%; height:auto;">
        </div>

        <!-- Navigation buttons -->
